  "solution": {
    "text": "$2^\\alpha \\cdot 3^\\beta \\cdot 5^\\gamma$<br/>$\\mathrm{B}=\\left[\\frac{50}{3}\\right]+\\left[\\frac{50}{3^2}\\right]+\\left[\\frac{50}{3^3}\\right]+\\left[\\frac{50}{3^4}\\right]$<br/>$=16+5+1$<br/>$=2$<br/>Maximum value of $n$ is 22"
